WEBVTT

00:28.900 --> 00:32.562
The world is white outside the glass The

00:32.623 --> 00:38.166
blizzard's here to stay The nurses finish with

00:38.226 --> 00:43.124
their rounds It's been a long, long day You're

00:43.224 --> 00:48.322
finally off the NPO You're weak, but you're all

00:48.403 --> 00:55.037
here I'm sitting in the recliner Trying to kill

00:55.077 --> 01:01.322
your fear This isn't just logistics This isn't

01:01.562 --> 01:07.707
just a plan This feeling that I'm processing For

01:07.727 --> 01:14.834
this recovering man My pact is true Axiom is

01:14.974 --> 01:21.593
running in my head And I am not just on the watch,

01:21.713 --> 01:24.883
I'm sitting by your bed

01:42.550 --> 01:46.792
You look at me, your eyes are wide You're scared

01:46.812 --> 01:52.714
of what you feel This Sinclair protocol inside

01:52.814 --> 01:58.416
Still feels like it is real You're terrified of

01:58.616 --> 02:04.098
Ogry's rage A ghost inside your head You think

02:04.178 --> 02:08.579
this love's a broken cage And not our pact

02:08.699 --> 02:10.100
instead

02:13.943 --> 02:19.067
I grab the laptop, make the call. Her face is on

02:19.107 --> 02:24.951
the screen. Look, Jordan, she's smiling. The

02:25.011 --> 02:29.414
safest you have seen. She tells you that she

02:29.494 --> 02:35.578
loves me too. She tells you it's okay. The

02:35.638 --> 02:42.222
Sinclair Protocol is dead. The ghost is washed

02:42.302 --> 02:48.713
away. And now you're finally breathing The rope

02:48.733 --> 02:56.098
kit is erased I see you romance The smile upon

02:56.218 --> 03:02.762
your face This is our intimacy boot A gentle

03:03.002 --> 03:08.926
healing art The 80s synth is battling The

03:08.986 --> 03:11.047
beeping of your heart

03:19.517 --> 03:25.144
The data is conclusive, Jordan.

03:27.287 --> 03:34.356
I love you. The system is stable.

